<title>SPAIN: Uralita sold 500,000 EIA shares - CNMV.</title>
<headline>Uralita sold 500,000 EIA shares - CNMV.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish building material firm Uralita has sold a stake of 500,000 shares in Energia Industrias Aragonesas (EIA), the stock market watchdog CNMV said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In an operation conducted at the end of May, Uralita sold the shares back to EIA, the CNMV said.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
